#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:2
msgid "Workflows |advanced-plus|"
msgstr "Flujos de trabajo |advanced-plus|"

#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:7
msgid ""
"Workflows are an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus Enterprise "
"and Advanced tiers."
msgstr ""
"Flujos de trabajo are an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus "
"Enterprise and Advanced tiers."

#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:9
msgid ""
"Workflows are groups of Tasks, which are described in detail in the "
"preceding section. Operational Workflows can be run on-demand against an "
"existing Instance or server from the Actions menu on the Instance or "
"server detail page. Additionally, they can be scheduled to run on a "
"recurring basis through Morpheus Jobs (|ProJob|)."
msgstr ""
"Flujos de trabajo are groups of Tareas, which are described in detail in "
"the preceding section. Operational Flujos de trabajo can be run on-demand"
" against an existing Instancia or server from the Actions menu on the "
"Instancia or server detail page. Additionally, they puede ser scheduled "
"to run on a recurring basis through Morpheus Jobs (|ProJob|)."

#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:11
msgid ""
"Provisioning Workflows are associated with Instances at provision time "
"(in the Automation tab of the Add Instance wizard) or after provisioning "
"through the Actions menu on the Instance detail page. Provisioning "
"Workflows assign Tasks to various stages of the Instance lifecycle, such "
"as Provision, Post Provision, and Teardown. When the Instance reaches a "
"given stage, the appropriate Tasks are run. Task results and output can "
"be viewed from the History tab of the Instance or server detail page."
msgstr ""
"Provisioning Flujos de trabajo are associated with Instancias at "
"provision time (in the Automation tab of the Add Instancia wizard) or "
"after provisioning through the Actions menu on the Instancia detail page."
" Provisioning Flujos de trabajo assign Tareas to various stages of the "
"Instancia lifecycle, such as Provision, Post Provision, and Teardown. "
"When the Instancia reaches a given stage, the appropriate Tareas are run."
" Tarea results and output puede ser viewed from the History tab of the "
"Instancia or server detail page."

